<h2>Profile <%= status %>!</h2>

<p>Dear <%= name %>,</p>

<% if (status === 'approved') { %>
  <p><strong>Congratulations!</strong> Your profile has been approved and is now live on FineEscorts Kenya.</p>
  <p>Clients can now view your profile and contact you. Make sure to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep your profile updated</li>
    <li>Respond to inquiries promptly</li>
    <li>Renew your subscription to stay visible</li>
  </ul>
  <a href="https://fineescorts.co.ke/<%= slug %>" class="btn">View Your Profile</a>
<% } else { %>
  <p>We regret to inform you that your profile was not approved at this time.</p>
  <p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= reason || 'Please contact support for more details.' %></p>
  <p>You can update your profile and resubmit for review.</p>
  <a href="https://fineescorts.co.ke/dashboard" class="btn">Update Profile</a>
<% } %>

<p>Best regards,<br>The FineEscorts Team</p>